section
open Formalism.FourierDecayAlt Formalism.FourierDecayAlt.R Formalism.FourierDecayAlt.Wd Formalism.FourierDecayAlt.Fr Formalism.REAL Formalism.QuantumDeterminants MeasureTheory GlobalTheory.HatNF

